ons cannot change.\nPlans persist. repeat counts complete executions, not rounds. Continuing work retains its exact operation, paid progress and reserved material; follow its cancellation contract. A global pause preserves costs. Normal satiety decline and successful outgoing messages do not stop plans. Urgent relevant messages, real failures, completed learning or new danger can cause a decision. Movement uses known geometry and real distance; an occupied coordinate is not a reachable meeting point. No effect happens merely because a plan describes it.\nReturn queries with result_json null, or queries=[] with result_json containing the JSON plan. A plan has intention:string, steps:[{action:{interface:string,args:object},repeat:positive integer,until:condition|null,guard:condition|null}], repeat:positive integer, until:condition|null, interrupts:string[], notes:string[], preferences:string[], projects:project[]. At most six steps, four projects and concise notes. A condition is {path,comparison,value}; comparison lt/lte/gt/gte/eq/neq; paths self.health/satiety/energy/temperature/happiness/inventory.RESOURCE or tick. Use interrupts=[] unless a supplied event is needed. A project has id,status(active/paused/completed/abandoned),question,evidence:string[],uncertainty,goal,completedSteps:string[],outputs:string[],missing,next,pauseReason,benefit. All other project fields are strings. Omitted projects persist. Give factual evidence and observed benefits, never claimed physical changes. Partial plans and protected-state edits are rejected.\nBatch up to four control queries. Each has section, search, ids:string[], offset>=0 and part>=0. Sections abilities/inventory/knowledge/projects/memory/state/observed; world may query only abilities. Exact IDs or text search; use empty search and ids for pagination. No implicit access outside this scope. Remaining query batches are explicit; when zero return a decision. Every model response, including retrieval and failure, consumes the shared budget.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_010c3b1be2996b00016b04509c67c487d1ba1db0ea7473aa9d","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrBFCc30sXJJtirczxZnvqXyNXHkXpUMr0VEWg42o1ZkRl6OZjAWNIIatc7IS0NoNTQKvXYKi2VR-6nMb8al7U19kXMlclw7w8vT2BvswECaMBK3sY1y3xEKWsVQq5-iu7yECnyi7stibpDL5s3h7iwmN7VeNTXec07rfQjBdKVSn6I_WqW4_zXOiF9_d7As0fIPSEjsISfokf06VgK3ygOtLUSMY7XVJJxDwV4P135yvb3GOanyD4qNzzFXANxlDJyZ97AOqIpFXJ5G3iRPC3KE1Jo3yEGZb_yGk79TZbJbkyQCZgkyNiCPs1kBayTXaIf7mt5uRqnXcFrUvRRT8-b9-PPsqLVTqVVwjBcNad76mnb5v9MSGfQhMVQjGi1ihhg71SQEDga4j3txdGeKNUddiftmPNOmMmDhEIFwaKriYIAZfv3Uu8hpFKpjs2fIsHkuzd6f74AYdJGQ_3fjBTP2CerxXbPn25_s--0R64N1BS0XdpZf6mbjNW86346Kc1K15Tj5ZJckt3XWMlH3EW1UH2gy7t3e-sq519KryCghAKLuQbW0Z4phmjPTr4VRzQgK6CDlCY_XpQ5B3ijWv4eYhStZ5RRx-JOrVYB6d_3jOgxW2MFB3bI2GgRuzhNAYRVxx0B2YEmnJFbgx9XZaYvAeY4_L8FlpvCZlrlb-kTSKwmhWi2voGpRHZ1xCiCadFl7NGJJ_LsookDo_xAm8A5tWK0uF0Vri76afBbY4uTrjOZwrawPaYtJIanLa5TlzuP4VaSxnmTTW-CX1EN7GeahJMKHqi-l9up_UQe3KBY10vraccqXzTVafJsbd8dzD4ybgf_Y65SjUs6RuxzSOZyJG2mivICAQYNk0gL3zOKffUNnTNCE49LR5KAUofv833OJEvyCuqa8RXHecMh8tag7MMVaiR1keO7eW2V2GT5LJVL5orXoWz2y_baNAktoDTT8CkYPr_HIzarkfss8dW5m0NaxSZb-wlcD5Cj83E411njl4LBV9bKAU2VSdbmBIk1Lqyuc0f0bSgCdUn8ZRgskXU_YSDNOkm_adcikrQeFo5Cjh3HX7Vmf8Diopu-ohv8cPu3FD4ZumCl9JSBZuvc7E3huzTUa7_r1PueTdP7kjS6yJNBEXHRQDko1rcJzTTappoe5Huumk53khZIneBXqKlPnKQjKzOFayc218DoAQKJFGaZPIusmFsPj-0HwCdYCyBNAvY-BeF-0hivlnayf7HzC-kztRj_ca2-gcll6ErGkzgT__qFyooaxT-wyHAGSWbQdQdasfVoSKCddhGkv2P68YvPO51XzO8ZeVU5VczESKO1SC8imbBTNEzDsrpbIPyUKUMOpz0EHwVt4j6naL4Mna8oGUbI7uXpE_nRDqlz259GriW3TAwcIed-em0TGAG70c7o9VbHJKGFh5pS8CpKwt7ybkiCskbSR8qzSR3A85hnqgHChsoEM77DaFSU2N7RR-r5h4mwMRm88nph5YPBHZdCMS5LOaCRhfN-p0Cmp6cR5XEISCsNQkAtC2ljcsfFXgSa1b8tkViH5499qPgiln1dNd1Bb2RLowI2TAM-qFKgy_zCT1gsbfQsmUUADZN-QLgKq1e-KKea_SVPLSWtqYSzq-4pmPba0IRiWW9o-ciUTHE2r3Gn0TgVIws23TPwvN8HbXgbrTq8CCvi8rOPwLDJ1yVsWrXBKRz5awzFgpwKWSKIZdxhOaDF6unSnACLUtacsmONDcsgWeawz5L2WFOztTOmoC5ZduuZWWqrwztj9toZqncJrMU3DRPAJ9bcyPAcxssEjPxhS0GNcJWyUeuamFN1m_CYxMRRAta